{"slug":"Ally","title":"Ally","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"See_also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Ally.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"42\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"42\" data-file-height=\"41\"><figcaption><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Ally</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Betray.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"41\" data-file-height=\"40\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Traitor\" class=\"\" title=\"Betray\">Betray</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/196px-Allied.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"98\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"290\" data-file-height=\"145\"><figcaption>An <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">ally</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Betrayed_embargo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"100\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Traitor\" class=\"\" title=\"Betray\">Betrayal</a> and <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">embargo</span> icon.</figcaption></figure>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Clan\" title=\"Clan\">Clan</a>.</div>\n<p>To <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">ally</span> a person in the mode <a href=\"/Free_for_All\" title=\"Free for All\">Free for All</a> you right click their <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">territory</span>, and select the handshake option.\n</p><p>If the player accepts, you become <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allies</span> for 5 minutes.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Details\">Details</h1></div>\n<p>In <a href=\"/Free_for_All\" title=\"Free for All\">Free for All</a> you can <a href=\"/Traitor\" class=\"\" title=\"Betray\">betray</a> and <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">ally</span> freely. Other players can not see who you are <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allied</span> with in this mode.\n</p><p>It works differently in the <a href=\"/Teams\" title=\"Teams\">Teams</a> mode. In this mode you are always <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allied</span> with your selected color and you are unable to <a href=\"/Traitor\" class=\"\" title=\"Betray\">betray</a> your <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allies</span>. The game tries to put your <a href=\"/Clan\" title=\"Clan\">clan</a> members in your <a href=\"/Teams\" title=\"Teams\">team</a>.\n</p><p>Being <a href=\"/Ally\" class=\"\" title=\"Allies\">allies</a> has multiple effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">Trade</a> is prioritized between <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allies</span>.</li>\n<li>You do not accidentally attack an <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">ally</span> with ground units or <a href=\"/Transport_Ship\" title=\"Transport Ship\">transport ships</a>.</li>\n<li>Your <a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">warships</a> no longer capture their <a href=\"/Trade_Ship\" title=\"Trade Ship\">trade ships</a>.</li>\n<li>You can send troops or <a href=\"/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a> to reinforce your <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">ally</span>.</li></ul>\n<p>Breaking an <a href=\"/Ally\" class=\"\" title=\"Alliance\">alliance</a> causes the status <a href=\"/Traitor\" title=\"Traitor\">Traitor</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Global 50% defense and 20% attack speed reduction for 30 seconds.</li>\n<li>Allies can break their <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">alliance</span> with the <a href=\"/Traitor\" title=\"Traitor\">traitor</a> without triggering the <a href=\"/Traitor\" title=\"Traitor\">traitor</a> status.</li>\n<li>An <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">embargo</span> is made, blocking <a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">trades</a> from being done until you either become <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">allies</span> again, or right click the player and select to allow <a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">trade</a>.</li>\n<li>The number of <a href=\"/Traitor\" class=\"\" title=\"Betray\">betrayals</a> on your information panel will increase by one.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"See_also\">See also</h2></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Free_for_All\" title=\"Free for All\">Free for All</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Teams\" title=\"Teams\">Teams</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Traitor\" title=\"Traitor\">Traitor</a></li></ul>","section":"Combat & mechanics"}
